# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5200005> (Abnormal pitch)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5200005> "Persistently abnormally high or low-pitched vocalization or speech than is considered the norm for the context of social situation or significantly different from baseline of the individual.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5200005> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5200005> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2592-4715>)
