# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210252> (Unusual oral thrush)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210252> "Increased susceptibility to oral candidiasis caused by Candida albicans, as manifested by recurrent or severe infection of the oral mucosa, or by oral thrush occurring beyond the neonatal period without an identifiable predisposing cause.")
