AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210280> "Infection of the oral cavity including the gingiva, periodontium, teeth, tongue, or oral mucosa that occurs in the context of unusual susceptibility to infection.")
