# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210409> (Abnormal effector memory CD4+ T cell proportion)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210409> "An abnormal proportion of effector memory CD4-positive memory T cells compared to the total number of T cells in the blood. These are memory cells that are short-lived cells that migrate to the site of an infection and attempt to eliminate the pathogen. These cells may have a CD3/CD4/CD62L-/CD45RA phenotype.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210409> "2026-06-14T14:32:48Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210409> "PMID:22343568")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210409> "Abnormal effector memory CD4+ T cell proportion")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210409> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0410379>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210411> (Decreased total T cell number)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210411> "Abnormal decrease of absolute number (either count per volume or proportion of total lymphocytes) of T cells or of a subset of T cells, commonly characterized as CD3+ lymphocytes, in the blood, compared to a reference range for a given sex and age-group. These may include both TCR alpha/beta and gamma/delta T cells.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210411> "2026-06-14T15:01:45Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210411> "Decreased numbers of circulating T cells")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210411> "Reduced number of T cells")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210411> "Decreased total T cell number")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210411> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011839>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210412> (Increased total T cell number)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210412> "Abnormal increase of absolute number (either count per volume or proportion of total lymphocytes) of T cells or of a subset of T cells, commonly characterized as CD3+ lymphocytes, in the blood, compared to a reference range for a given sex and age-group. These may include both TCR alpha/beta and gamma/delta T cells.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5210412> "2026-06-14T15:01:58Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
